From 5af4fd8bd74fdedd00fd1283821f16ba6276d4d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dnz3d4c <dnz3d4c@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 10:01:27 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Compat: fetch the Korean Dalamud updater instead of sending
 the user away

Dalamud reaches the Korean client through a separate program (MiqoKR's
KR Dalamud updater), and until now the installer stopped when it was
missing and printed a path for the user to go find. The vnavmesh step in
the same run does the opposite - it downloads its dependency from the
author's own release. Two foreign plugins of the same kind, one fetched
and one handed off.

So this fetches it too, the same way:

  - the latest release is asked for by API, no pinned tag
  - only the "Portable" asset is taken. The release also publishes a
    "Payload" zip for the updater's own self-update; that one extracts
    cleanly and leaves nothing runnable behind, which is why the choice
    is a named rule and not "the first zip"
  - it unpacks whole into %LOCALAPPDATA%\KR-Dalamud-Updater\app, because
    the archive is flat and UpdaterReleaseConfig.json has to stay beside
    the exe for the updater's self-update to work

This is a download, not a redistribution. That repository carries no
license, so the archive must not travel inside ours - taking it from
upstream on the user's behalf touches nothing the license would cover.

What is still left to the user is the one button: Dalamud itself only
arrives when Check Update is pressed in the updater's own window, so the
installer opens that window and says so. Being able to tell "the updater
is missing" from "Dalamud is missing" is the point - the first is ours to
solve, the second is not.

The five constants that decide where it comes from and where it lands are
mirrored in tools/kr-setup/kr_profile.py, and a test fails if the two
drift apart. Same guard as the profile root: a path we unpack to and a
path we look in must not disagree silently.
---
 Installer/InstallerService.cs | 152 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 Installer/KrProfile.cs        |  42 +++++++++-
 Installer/Loc.cs              |  51 ++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 236 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

